{'symbol': 'AVGO', 'date': '2021-12-09 16:16:00', 'title': 'BROADCOM INC. ANNOUNCES $10 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF., DEC. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADCOM INC. (NASDAQ: AVGO), A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER THAT DESIGNS, DEVELOPS AND SUPPLIES SEMICONDUCTOR AND INFRASTRUCTURE SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED THE REPURCHASE OF UP TO $10 BILLION OF ITS COMMON STOCK UNDER A NEW SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM.'}{'symbol': 'AVGO', 'date': '2021-12-09 16:15:00', 'title': 'BROADCOM INC. ANNOUNCES FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL YEAR 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS AND QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF., DEC. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADCOM INC. (NASDAQ: AVGO), A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER THAT DESIGNS, DEVELOPS AND SUPPLIES SEMICONDUCTOR AND INFRASTRUCTURE SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS, TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL YEAR 2021, ENDED OCTOBER 31, 2021, PROVIDED GUIDANCE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF ITS FISCAL YEAR 2022 AND ANNOUNCED ITS QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS.'}